        {:des "hyper+r (r)aycast sublayer keys"
 :rules [;; Map qwerty equivalent in Colemak, i.e. k for e.
         ;; g
         [:##t "open raycast://extensions/josephschmitt/gif-search/search" [:r-sub-layer-mode]]
         ;; '
